AVERAGE DEGREE IS ADDITIVE UNDER [] :  avgdeg(G[]H) = avgdeg(G)+avgdeg(H)
Atomic avg degrees a(n) = 2u(n)/n  (proven u(n), AMP):
   a( 3) = 2*3/3 =    2/1  = 2.0000
   a( 4) = 2*5/4 =    5/2  = 2.5000
   a( 5) = 2*7/5 =   14/5  = 2.8000
   a( 6) = 2*9/6 =    3/1  = 3.0000
   a( 7) = 2*12/7 =   24/7  = 3.4286
   a( 8) = 2*14/8 =    7/2  = 3.5000
   a( 9) = 2*18/9 =    4/1  = 4.0000
   a(10) = 2*20/10 =    4/1  = 4.0000
   a(11) = 2*23/11 =  46/11  = 4.1818
   a(12) = 2*27/12 =    9/2  = 4.5000
